{"seq":2,"slug":"bonded-warehouse-inventory","title":"保税仓库存与海关台账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/import-mode-bonded/bonded-warehouse-inventory","wordCount":1874,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"保税仓库存与海关台账\">保税仓库存与海关台账</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>保税仓里的货有一个反直觉的双重身份：<strong>物理上它是可拣可盘的实物，法律上它还没进口</strong>。这批货在海关系统里对应一本账册（电子账册），账册上记的每一笔增减都必须有对应的海关单据支撑——入区有入区报关单，出区有申报清单，账册余额必须与实物在库量一致，海关随时可能盘库核销。这意味着保税库存不能按普通电商库存那样「先扣减、后补单」，任何一次库存变动都必须在同一时刻产生对应的账册记录。</p>\n<p>这个「库存即账册」的约束，是保税仓系统与普通 WMS 最本质的区别。普通 WMS 的库存是运营数据，允许有误差再盘点校正；保税账册是法律数据，误差本身即违规。因此系统设计的第一原则是：<strong>库存变动必须与账册变动原子绑定，不允许出现只有一边的情况</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[境外批量发货] --&gt; B[到港申报入区]&#10;  B --&gt; C[实物上架 + 账册增量]&#10;  C --&gt; D[在库库存]&#10;  D --&gt; E[消费者下单/出区申报]&#10;  E --&gt; F[账册出库 + 实物拣货]&#10;  F --&gt; G[发货出区]&#10;  D --&gt; H[盘库: 账实核对]&#10;  H --&gt;|差异| I[差异工单]&#10;  D --&gt; J[退换/销毁/退运]&#10;  J --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[境外批量发货] --&gt; B[到港申报入区]\n  B --&gt; C[实物上架 + 账册增量]\n  C --&gt; D[在库库存]\n  D --&gt; E[消费者下单/出区申报]\n  E --&gt; F[账册出库 + 实物拣货]\n  F --&gt; G[发货出区]\n  D --&gt; H[盘库: 账实核对]\n  H --&gt;|差异| I[差异工单]\n  D --&gt; J[退换/销毁/退运]\n  J --&gt; C</pre><h3 id=\"账册的类型与粒度\">账册的类型与粒度</h3><p>海关账册（通常称「跨境电商账册」或「保税账册」）按监管场所与经营主体开立，其明细粒度通常到<strong>商品项号 + 账册商品编号（对应 HS 编码）</strong>。系统里需要把「我们的 SKU」映射到「账册商品项」，这种映射常是一对多或一对一的，取决于同一 SKU 是否因为批次或税号差异需分项管理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>系统实体</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td><code>product_sku</code></td>\n<td>业务侧最小库存单位，含规格、批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账册商品项</td>\n<td><code>ledger_item</code></td>\n<td>海关侧最小记账单位，绑定 HS 编码与法定计量单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账册</td>\n<td><code>duty_ledger</code></td>\n<td>按监管场所 + 经营主体开立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账册明细</td>\n<td><code>ledger_entry</code></td>\n<td>只追加的流水，每笔带单据类型与单据号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在库快照</td>\n<td><code>stock_snapshot</code></td>\n<td>由明细汇总得到，可重建，非权威</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键设计判断：<strong>明细是权威，快照是派生</strong>。快照表只是为了查询性能，任何对账争议都以明细为准，因此明细必须只追加、不可修改、不可删除，纠正错误只能用反向分录（红冲），这与复式记账的思路一致 (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Double-entry_bookkeeping\">Wikipedia: Double-entry bookkeeping</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库存状态的建模\">库存状态的建模</h2><p>保税库存不能用一个 <code>qty</code> 字段表示，因为同一批货处在不同的可用状态。至少要区分：在库可用（可被订单占用）、已占用待出区（已被订单锁定但尚未申报放行）、待处理（残损、待销毁、待退运）、在途（已申报入区但未上架）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; InTransit: 入区申报&#10;  InTransit --&gt; Available: 上架完成&#10;  Available --&gt; Reserved: 订单占用&#10;  Reserved --&gt; Shipped: 出区放行&#10;  Reserved --&gt; Available: 订单取消/超时释放&#10;  Available --&gt; Damaged: 残损&#10;  Damaged --&gt; Destroyed: 销毁核销&#10;  Available --&gt; Returned: 退运出境&#10;  Shipped --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; InTransit: 入区申报\n  InTransit --&gt; Available: 上架完成\n  Available --&gt; Reserved: 订单占用\n  Reserved --&gt; Shipped: 出区放行\n  Reserved --&gt; Available: 订单取消/超时释放\n  Available --&gt; Damaged: 残损\n  Damaged --&gt; Destroyed: 销毁核销\n  Available --&gt; Returned: 退运出境\n  Shipped --&gt; [*]</pre><p>状态之间的迁移必须与账册动作对应。比如 <code>Available → Reserved</code> 只改可用量、账册不动（因为货还没出区）；<code>Reserved → Shipped</code> 才产生账册出库记录。把这两步分开的意义在于：订单占用是业务行为，出区申报是法律行为，中间可能有很长的时间差，且随时可能因为三单不一致而回退。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可用量的计算口径\">可用量的计算口径</h3><p>可用量必须显式扣除已占用与冻结部分，否则会出现超卖。设入区总量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>、已出区量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、已占用待出区量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、待处理量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、安全库存阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{avail} = Q - S - R - D - \\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 不是运营安全库存，而是<strong>额度缓冲</strong>——因为账册核销存在时间滞后（申报放行到账册实际扣减可能有秒级到分钟级延迟），完全不设缓冲会因并发导致瞬时负库存。实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 取一个小的常数（如个位数）即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账册流水的表结构\">账册流水的表结构</h2><p>把上面的模型落到表上，核心是两条只追加的流水表：账册明细（法律账）与库存流水（业务账），二者通过 <code>order_id</code> / <code>declaration_id</code> 关联。下面给出可直接落地的 DDL 骨架。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE duty_ledger (&#10;  ledger_id      BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  ledger_code    VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL UNIQUE,  -- 账册编号&#10;  customs_zone   VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,         -- 监管场所代码&#10;  operator_code  VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,         -- 经营主体(区内企业)代码&#10;  status         VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;active&#39;,&#10;  opened_at      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  closed_at      DATE NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE ledger_entry (&#10;  entry_id       BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  ledger_id      BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES duty_ledger(ledger_id),&#10;  ledger_item_no VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,   -- 账册商品项号&#10;  hs_code        VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL,   -- 对应税则号列&#10;  direction      SMALLINT NOT NULL,      -- 1 入账, -1 出账&#10;  qty            NUMERIC(16,4) NOT NULL CHECK (qty &gt; 0),&#10;  doc_type       VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- inbound_decl | manifest | adjust&#10;  doc_no         VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  order_id       BIGINT NULL,&#10;  occurred_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT uq_entry_doc UNIQUE (doc_type, doc_no, ledger_item_no, direction)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 出账必须有单据与订单; 且同一单据同一明细不可重复计账&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_entry_ledger_item ON ledger_entry(ledger_id, ledger_item_no, occurred_at);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_entry_order ON ledger_entry(order_id) WHERE order_id IS NOT NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> duty_ledger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 账册编号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customs_zone   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 监管场所代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  operator_code  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 经营主体(区内企业)代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opened_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ledger_entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duty_ledger(ledger_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_item_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 账册商品项号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_code        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对应税则号列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1 入账, -1 出账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  doc_type       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- inbound_decl | manifest | adjust</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  doc_no         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uq_entry_doc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (doc_type, doc_no, ledger_item_no, direction)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 出账必须有单据与订单; 且同一单据同一明细不可重复计账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_entry_ledger_item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ledger_entry(ledger_id, ledger_item_no, occurred_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_entry_order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ledger_entry(order_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uq_entry_doc</code> 这个唯一约束承担了两个职责：一是防止消息重投导致的重复入账，二是让「同一申报单不能对同一明细记两次」成为数据库层面的不变量，而不是靠应用层 if 判断。这是账务类系统的通用做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"盘库核销与差异处置\">盘库核销与差异处置</h2><p>海关会定期或不定期要求企业盘库，比对账册结存与实物在库。系统要能一键生成「账面结存」，并支持录入实盘数、输出差异。差异只有三种处置方向：补记（实物多于账面，通常是漏记入区）、核减（实物少于账面，通常是漏记出区或损耗）、挂账待查（原因不明，需工单跟进）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"差异的分类与处置路径\">差异的分类与处置路径</h3><p>把差异按「实物 vs 账面」与「单据是否可解释」两个维度交叉，能得到四种情形，每种对应不同的处置动作。这张表是盘库工单自动分流的依据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>实物 vs 账面</th>\n<th>单据可解释</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>漏记入区</td>\n<td>实物 &gt; 账面</td>\n<td>是（有入区单未记账）</td>\n<td>补记入账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏记出区</td>\n<td>实物 &lt; 账面</td>\n<td>是（有出区单未记账）</td>\n<td>补记出账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盘盈</td>\n<td>实物 &gt; 账面</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>挂账待查 + 上报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盘亏</td>\n<td>实物 &lt; 账面</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>挂账待查 + 上报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>差异率是监管关注的核心指标。设某明细项账面结存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、实盘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，差异率定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = \\frac{|A - B|}{\\max(B, 1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上的做法不是压差异率，而是<strong>让差异可解释</strong>：每一笔差异都要能落到一张单据上。做不到解释的差异，才是风险。因此盘库功能的核心不是「算差异」，而是「给差异找单据」——系统应能按明细项反查该时间窗内所有相关单据，自动匹配可解释项。</p>\n<h3 id=\"账册核销的时序约束\">账册核销的时序约束</h3><p>出区申报放行到账册实际扣减之间存在时间差，这个差值构成了核销窗口。系统必须保证窗口内的账册余额始终非负，否则会出现「先出区后补账」的违规形态。做法是在申报前做一次预扣（写一条 pending 分录），放行回执到达后把 pending 转为正式分录，退单则释放 pending。这个模式与支付系统的授权/请款两阶段非常接近，可迁移使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保税库存是「物理实物 + 法律账册」的双重身份，库存变动必须与账册变动原子绑定。</li>\n<li>账册明细只追加、快照为派生；纠错用红冲而非修改，与复式记账一致。</li>\n<li>库存状态要区分在库可用、已占用待出区、待处理、在途，状态迁移与账册动作分开。</li>\n<li>可用量需显式扣除占用与冻结，并保留小的额度缓冲以吸收账册核销延迟。</li>\n<li>唯一约束是防重复入账的第一道防线，应把「同一单据不重复计账」写成数据库不变量。</li>\n<li>盘库差异的处置方向只有补记、核减、挂账待查三种，目标是让每笔差异可解释。</li>\n<li>核销窗口内的账册余额必须始终非负，用预扣/转正/释放的两阶段模式保证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>库存里每一笔出区都对应一笔待申报交易，这笔交易的三条事实如何对齐，见 <a href=\"../three-docs-match/order-payment-logistics-doc\">订单单/支付单/运单数据模型</a>；而账册出库后与税款的对账，见 <a href=\"../bonded-tax-settlement/bonded-reconcile-audit\">保税库存/税款对账与审计</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保税仓库存与海关台账","id":"保税仓库存与海关台账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"账册的类型与粒度","id":"账册的类型与粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"库存状态的建模","id":"库存状态的建模"},{"level":3,"text":"可用量的计算口径","id":"可用量的计算口径"},{"level":2,"text":"账册流水的表结构","id":"账册流水的表结构"},{"level":2,"text":"盘库核销与差异处置","id":"盘库核销与差异处置"},{"level":3,"text":"差异的分类与处置路径","id":"差异的分类与处置路径"},{"level":3,"text":"账册核销的时序约束","id":"账册核销的时序约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"直邮/保税备货/一般贸易选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/import-mode-bonded/import-mode-selection"},"next":{"title":"个人额度/单次限额与商品范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/import-mode-bonded/bonded-quota-purchase-limit"}}